and 22, doxorubicin 30 mg/m2 IV day 2, and cisplatin 70 mg/m2 day 2 of a 4-week cycle. The trial was terminated 
prematurely due to slow accrual. RESULTS Prior to early closure of the protocol, there were 15 patients entered on the 
AC regimen and 13 to the MVAC regimen. There were 3 PR (20%) for AC and 3 CR (23%) and 3 PR (23%) for MVAC. Median PFS 
was 4.0 months for AC and 6.9 months for MVAC. Median survival was 13.2 months for AC and 16.8 months for MVAC. Toxicity
was substantial for MVAC vs. AC with severe leukopenia seen in 69% vs. 33% of patients and severe thrombocytopenia 23% 
